<title>UK: E.Midlands airport passenger traffic falls.</title>
<headline>E.Midlands airport passenger traffic falls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Express Group Plc said passenger traffic at the East Midlands Airport fell 8.1 percent in the third quarter from a year ago to 640,000.</p>
<p>It said the decline was expected to continue into the final quarter and passenger numbers for the year as a whole was anticipated to be some 5.0 to 7.5 percent down on 1995.</p>
</text>
